--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The shipped application has ZERO runtime dependencies. Nothing is fetched
from a third-party origin at call time; the Content-Security-Policy is
`default-src 'self'` and would block it if anything tried.

The following third-party assets are OPTIONAL. They are not present in this
repository and are not downloaded by default. They are fetched only if you
run tape-app/public/vendor/fetch.sh, and used only by the presence-window
work, which is off unless explicitly enabled with `?window=1`:

